  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 『機動戦士ガンダム 00』10周年にあわせ、「刹那・F・セイエイ」のパイロットスーツをイメージした、ガンダムマイスターカラーのプチッガイが登場！",
      "en": "• To coincide with the 10th episode of \"Mobile Suit Gundam 00 \", Petit'gguy in Gundam Meister color, inspired by \" Setsuna F. Seiei\"'s pilot suit, is now available!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胴体に貼るパイロットスーツをイメージしたシールに加え、プラカードに貼って楽しむキャラクターの名セリフを表記したシールが付属！",
      "en": "• In addition to a seal inspired by a pilot suit that can be pasted on the torso, a seal with famous lines from characters that can be pasted on placards is also included!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• いろいろな場所に貼れるおまけのシールも登場！",
      "en": "• Additional Seals that can be pasted in various places are also available!"
